      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1016,
        "height": 348,
        "content": "# Free setup guide and PDF checklist\n\n\n## Stuck on Meta tokens or IDs? The guide walks through each step, with a free PDF pack:\n### - 16 point pre-flight checklist\n### - Token and ID cheat sheet with an error decoder\n### - 20 ready prompt starters for your bot\n\n\n\n## Guide and download: https://uzzaman.dev/guides/instagram-facebook-auto-posting-setup/"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
